id=netstats-fix-lite
name=Network Stats Fix (Proxy Only - Lite)
version=v10-lite
versionCode=10
author=opencode
description=Lightweight native binder proxy fix for broken traffic indicator. No BPF restoration (safe for devices where BPF causes 'no internet'). Reads /proc/net/dev directly via binder interception. Suitable for legacy kernels (<4.9) and devices with SELinux restrictions.
